// Release builds: the signing settings, plus the public half of the key that signs updates.
// The private half is the SPARKLE_ED_PRIVATE_KEY secret, never in the repo (docs/RELEASING.md).
// While this is empty, the app doesn't check for updates, which is how forks build.

